From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jerry Zhao <jerryz123@berkeley.edu>
Subject: [PATCH] Recognize opcode-free supervisor profile guarantees
Purpose: Preserves supervisor guarantee names in the embedded Spike ISA parser.
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

These properties describe existing supervisor behavior, not new instructions
or CSR switches. Register their names without changing execution semantics.

diff --git a/disasm/isa_parser.cc b/disasm/isa_parser.cc
--- a/disasm/isa_parser.cc
+++ b/disasm/isa_parser.cc
@@ -94,2 +94,7 @@ static const extension_info_t extension_infos[] = {
   {"h", {'H'}},
+  {"ssccptr"},
+  {"sstvecd"},
+  {"sstvala"},
+  {"sscounterenw"},
+  {"ssu64xl"},
   {"sha", {}, {"h", "ssstateen", "shcounterenw", "shvstvala", "shtvala", "shvstvecd", "shvsatpa", "shgatpa"}},
